      "content_sha256": "0084a276293942e452a57ae89af13cdbf415751ec905ff95b458cceebc007768",
      "score": 120,
      "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"simplemessenger\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/shihabshahrier/SimpleMessenger#readme\",\n  \"bugs\": {\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/shihabshahrier/SimpleMessenger/issues\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/shihabshahrier/SimpleMessenger.git\"\n  },\n  \"license\": \"ISC\",\n  \"author\": \"shahriar\",\n  \"type\": \"commonjs\",\n  \"main\": \"index.js\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"echo \\\"Error: no test specified\\\" && exit 1\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"express\": \"^4.21.2\",\n    \"socket.io\": \"^4.8.1\"\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "sha": null,
      "content_sha256": "5d9460247454bc19af1e2ba357304f7ee0f32b8116208390e26677aa44b34694",
      "score": 100,
      "content": "<!-- write an instruction to run the code express app-->\n\n## How to run the code\n1. Clone the repository\n2. Open the terminal and navigate to the project folder\n3. Run the following command to install the required packages\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n4. Run the following command to start the express server\n```bash\nnode index.js\n```\n5. Open the browser and navigate to http://localhost:3000\n\n\n## Run it using Docker\n1. Make sure you have Docker installed on your machine\n2. Run the following command to build the Docker image\n```bash\ndocker build -t simple-messenger\n```\n3. Run the following command to start the Docker container\n```bash\ndocker run -p 3000:3000 simple-messenger\n```\n4. Open the browser and navigate to http://localhost:3000\n\n \n\n\n\n\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "Dockerfile",
      "sha": null,
      "content_sha256": "f127832b4724732ba8a14e9f0d0c61aa764b77c40649d39ecf038fb79e2776d5",
      "score": 85,
      "content": "FROM ubuntu\n\n# Install the necessary packages\nRUN apt-get update\nRUN apt-get install -y curl\nRUN curl -sL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_18.x | bash -\nRUN apt-get upgrade -y\nRUN apt-get install -y nodejs\n\n# Create the app directory\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Copy the source code\nCOPY package.json package.json\nCOPY package-lock.json package-lock.json\n\nRUN npm install\n\nCOPY ./public public\nCOPY index.js index.js\n\n\n# Expose the port\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nENTRYPOINT [ \"node\", \"index.js\" ]\n"
    },
